<title>USA: Hughes gets $133 mln missile contract.</title>
<headline>Hughes gets $133 mln missile contract.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Missile Systems Co said Friday that it won a $133 million contract to produce 433 Advanced Medium-Range Air-to-Air Missiles.</p>
<p>Hughes Missile Systems is a unit of Hughes Electronics Corp's Hughes Aircraft Co.</p>
<p>The missiles will be made in Tucson and the order is expected to be completed in September 1999, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
